From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 14:49:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] brand: asset + settings brand/doc-link sweep
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Repoint the // zed.dev/docs comment links in the seed settings/keymap
  files (initial_*.json, keymaps) to the fork docs base.
- default.json: replace the dead hosted agent default_model
  (zed.dev / claude-sonnet-4) with a local Ollama default (overridable);
  update the model_parameters example to a self-hosted provider; repoint the
  vestigial server_url off zed.dev (nothing connects to it; the client just
  requires a value).

Bundled theme $schema URLs (zed.dev/schema/themes) are left as-is — they are
theme-authoring metadata validated against Zed's compatible schema, not a
user-facing surface, and the fork hosts no replacement schema.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
